            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "On Amazon on 28 November 2026, MERACH walking pads cost $199.99 to $282.12 and its folding treadmills $229.99 to $552.49. MERACH’s own store charged $279.99 to $499.99 for the six models it lists, from the W50 TrekPad to the T12 Aura.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "How much is the MERACH W50 walking pad?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "The W50 TrekPad was $256.49 on Amazon and $279.99 on MERACH’s store on 28 November 2026. The cheaper W50 Lite, with a 350 lb rating and 10% incline, was $199.99 on Amazon. MERACH listed the W50 TrekPad at $299.99 through October and early November.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "How much is the MERACH T12 treadmill?",
