            delivery is curbside. A 70 lb walking pad is manageable; a 100 lb T12 at the kerb needs two people. MERACH
            lists $9.99 and $19.99 rates for items that ship from China, but its treadmill pages showed free shipping.
            Our <a href="/treadmill-warranty-guide/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">treadmill warranty guide</a> explains how to weigh frame, motor and parts
            cover.
